{
  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "With only one completed experiment (config_001: RNA-only, singleprofile, PCA → 48.5% acc), evidence is extremely sparse. The most critical uncertainty is whether the image modality carries comparable or complementary signal to RNA. Config_010 (image_only, singleprofile, resnet50) is the cleanest direct counterpart to config_001, swapping only the modality while keeping profile setting and simplicity level identical. This isolates the modality effect and tells us whether image features are informative at all, which determines whether multimodal fusion is worth pursuing in later experiments. Under a 10-experiment budget, establishing the relative value of each modality early is essential before investing in more complex multimodal or multiprofile configurations."
}

